    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86118" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραγμᾰτ-ευτέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be laboured at,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο τῷ νομοθέτῃ π., ὅπως . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1333a14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ νομοθέτῃ π. περί τι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1337a11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τέον,</span>
			<i>one must treat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Top.</u>
					105b31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				106a2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Ren.Ves.</u>
				13.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must arrange, distribute,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
				<u>C.</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
